    "tempted": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
        {"zh": "我闻到了树叶的香味，好想吃！", "en": "Smell those leaves. Need to eat!"},
        {"zh": "这么好的树叶，怎么不享用呢？", "en": "Nice leaves. Why not eat?"},
        {"zh": "这棵树上叶子多，去啃两口！", "en": "Plenty of leaves on that tree!"},
        {"zh": "树叶这么美味，快快享用吧！", "en": "Such tasty leaves, enjoy!"},
        {"zh": "这么多美食，怎么忍得住不吃？", "en": "So many tasty treats. Can’t resist!"},
        {"zh": "这片树林树叶丰富，足够我吃上一阵子。", "en": "Abundant leaves in this forest. Plenty to eat."},
        {"zh": "这些树叶真好吃，越吃越想吃！", "en": "These leaves so tasty. Want more!"},
        {"zh": "树叶对我很重要，快给我吧！", "en": "Leaves are important. Give me!"},
        {"zh": "这片草地上树叶茂盛，正适合觅食。", "en": "Rich with leaves. Great for foraging."},
        {"zh": "这里树叶太多，吃都吃不完！", "en": "Leaves everywhere. Will never run out."}
      ]
    },
